See .agent-docs in the relevant directory for documentation of referenced
libraries.

For rust packages, you can use ./doc-cargo to pull in docs for a crate.
(e.g. `cd tributary-server && ../doc-cargo rand`)
It dumps packages for the library into .agent-docs

The postgres credentials for the test database are in tributary-server/.env

If you're looking for a github project, check the home directory of this
VM. There's a chance it's been fetched already.

You may need my help getting docs for a package you're having issues with.
Pause and let me know if you need help fetching something.
